WEBVTT

1
00:00:30.083 --> 00:00:31.583
In the previous two verses,

2
00:00:31.583 --> 00:00:33.833
we understood in detail

3
00:00:33.833 --> 00:00:35.041
that when a yogi's mind

4
00:00:35.041 --> 00:00:37.500
becomes pure and calm,

5
00:00:37.500 --> 00:00:40.375
they experience supreme happiness.

6
00:00:40.375 --> 00:00:42.208
Through continuous yoga practice,

7
00:00:42.208 --> 00:00:44.958
they become free from materialism

8
00:00:44.958 --> 00:00:48.458
and establish contact with 
Brahman, meaning Paramātmā.

9
00:00:48.458 --> 00:00:51.416
Now in this verse, Lord Krishna clarifies

10
00:00:51.416 --> 00:00:52.500
how such a yogi

11
00:00:52.500 --> 00:00:55.458
views this world.

12
00:01:00.000 --> 00:01:01.458
Lord Krishna says

13
00:01:01.458 --> 00:01:02.250
that the person who has

14
00:01:02.250 --> 00:01:05.750
established contact with God through yoga

15
00:01:05.750 --> 00:01:09.083
sees Him in all beings,

16
00:01:09.083 --> 00:01:12.708
and also sees all beings in Him.

17
00:01:12.708 --> 00:01:14.958
Let's understand this...

18
00:01:14.958 --> 00:01:19.625
The first part of this verse explains
 that Lord Paramātmā is present

19
00:01:19.625 --> 00:01:22.750
in the hearts of all beings.

20
00:01:22.750 --> 00:01:24.125
Whatever those beings may be like

21
00:01:24.125 --> 00:01:27.583
in appearance or behavior, a yogi

22
00:01:27.583 --> 00:01:32.375
can look beyond the outer covering of 
their biological body and behaviors

23
00:01:32.375 --> 00:01:34.708
and experience Paramātmā.

24
00:01:34.708 --> 00:01:37.250
This is not an intellectual experience

25
00:01:37.250 --> 00:01:41.000
that can come by reading or
 understanding something.

26
00:01:41.000 --> 00:01:44.458
For this experience, spiritual depth

27
00:01:44.458 --> 00:01:47.500
and the supreme state of yoga are needed.

28
00:01:47.500 --> 00:01:49.583
Then the second part of this verse

29
00:01:49.583 --> 00:01:51.750
is a reflection of the first part.

30
00:01:51.750 --> 00:01:53.000
That yogi also sees

31
00:01:53.000 --> 00:01:56.375
all these beings in that same Lord.

32
00:01:56.375 --> 00:02:00.833
Meaning whatever exists in this creation

33
00:02:00.833 --> 00:02:02.458
is all established in His very powers.

34
00:02:02.458 --> 00:02:07.291
He alone is the foundation of the entire 
creation and the beings living in it.

35
00:02:07.291 --> 00:02:10.625
This understanding gives 
the yogi a wonderful vision,

36
00:02:10.625 --> 00:02:12.791
which has been called sama-darshana –

37
00:02:12.791 --> 00:02:15.750
meaning beyond any discrimination,

38
00:02:15.750 --> 00:02:18.625
seeing everyone with equal vision.

39
00:02:18.625 --> 00:02:19.791
For such a yogi,

40
00:02:19.791 --> 00:02:22.583
rich, poor – learned, uneducated,

41
00:02:22.583 --> 00:02:27.833
even animals/ birds and humans, all are equal.

42
00:02:27.833 --> 00:02:30.375
All are parts of Paramātmā.

43
00:02:30.375 --> 00:02:33.666
This understanding completely frees a yogi

44
00:02:33.666 --> 00:02:38.791
from all negative emotions 
like jealousy, malice, hatred.

45
00:02:38.791 --> 00:02:41.958
For this yogi, life's ups and downs are also

46
00:02:41.958 --> 00:02:43.625
all equal,

47
00:02:43.625 --> 00:02:46.250
because everything is Paramātmā's will.

48
00:02:46.250 --> 00:02:49.375
Success/failure, happiness/sorrow,

49
00:02:49.375 --> 00:02:52.500
in all these that yogi remains equal,

50
00:02:52.500 --> 00:02:55.625
only remains surrendered to Paramātmā.

51
00:02:55.625 --> 00:02:58.708
Such a yogi has risen above materialism.

52
00:02:58.708 --> 00:03:02.750
They experience every moment of life only

53
00:03:02.750 --> 00:03:06.791
like the infinite bliss of 
being connected with God.

54
00:03:11.625 --> 00:03:14.458
Jealousy in personal life –

55
00:03:14.458 --> 00:03:18.750
you must have experienced this too?

56
00:03:18.750 --> 00:03:20.750
When it feels like

57
00:03:20.750 --> 00:03:23.125
"someone else has more than me.

58
00:03:23.125 --> 00:03:27.416
More success, more wealth, more respect."

59
00:03:27.416 --> 00:03:30.291
This jealousy is only because

60
00:03:30.291 --> 00:03:35.750
a person views life from a material perspective
 – measures it based on wealth,

61
00:03:35.750 --> 00:03:39.916
position, popularity, etc. And jealousy

62
00:03:39.916 --> 00:03:43.583
only increases restlessness in the mind.

63
00:03:43.583 --> 00:03:47.291
But two things must be known here.

64
00:03:47.291 --> 00:03:50.250
First thing – you're being jealous by seeing

65
00:03:50.250 --> 00:03:55.250
only one part of someone else's life.

66
00:03:55.250 --> 00:03:59.000
Your life also has many good things,

67
00:03:59.000 --> 00:04:01.875
why ignore them?

68
00:04:01.875 --> 00:04:05.166
If you look properly, you'll know –

69
00:04:05.166 --> 00:04:08.500
everyone's life has difficulties

70
00:04:08.500 --> 00:04:10.291
and also good things.

71
00:04:10.291 --> 00:04:14.625
Second and most important thing –

72
00:04:14.625 --> 00:04:17.125
know this secret:

73
00:04:17.125 --> 00:04:19.875
no person achieves success

74
00:04:19.875 --> 00:04:23.708
only through their hard work.

75
00:04:23.708 --> 00:04:28.875
I reside in the heart of every being,

76
00:04:28.875 --> 00:04:35.541
I am providing strength and 
right direction to everyone.

77
00:04:35.541 --> 00:04:39.333
What is necessary for someone else's life,

78
00:04:39.333 --> 00:04:41.166
I know.

79
00:04:41.166 --> 00:04:46.041
According to that, I guide them.

80
00:04:46.041 --> 00:04:49.250
What is important for your life too,

81
00:04:49.250 --> 00:04:53.750
according to that I am also guiding you.

82
00:04:53.750 --> 00:04:57.875
Who's ahead, who's behind –

83
00:04:57.875 --> 00:05:00.875
this is your limited vision.

84
00:05:00.875 --> 00:05:05.458
I am taking everyone on the right path.

85
00:05:05.458 --> 00:05:09.166
So rise above this ahead-behind thinking.

86
00:05:09.166 --> 00:05:13.625
You just keep walking with faith in me.

87
00:05:13.625 --> 00:05:16.000
And yes, if I am

88
00:05:16.000 --> 00:05:20.125
present in you and in everyone,

89
00:05:20.125 --> 00:05:22.375
then why jealousy?

90
00:05:22.375 --> 00:05:28.458
Seeing others' advancement, 
take inspiration, not jealousy.

91
00:05:28.458 --> 00:05:31.041
This is positive thinking.

92
00:05:31.041 --> 00:05:34.791
So next time when jealousy comes to mind,

93
00:05:34.791 --> 00:05:42.625
first recognize it, and then
 change your perspective once.

94
00:05:42.625 --> 00:05:46.166
Today you see someone else successful,

95
00:05:46.166 --> 00:05:49.166
tomorrow you will also be successful.

96
00:05:49.166 --> 00:05:54.583
Because I am with you too.

97
00:05:54.583 --> 00:05:56.208
You just keep doing karma

98
00:05:56.208 --> 00:05:59.916
with hard work and devotion.

99
00:06:04.958 --> 00:06:07.083
Think –

100
00:06:07.083 --> 00:06:11.208
why does tension arise in the family?

101
00:06:11.208 --> 00:06:14.000
This happens only when family members think

102
00:06:14.000 --> 00:06:18.291
that someone is right, someone is wrong –

103
00:06:18.291 --> 00:06:18.958
or

104
00:06:18.958 --> 00:06:21.166
someone is ahead, someone is behind.

105
00:06:21.166 --> 00:06:24.333
These are all material perspectives,

106
00:06:24.333 --> 00:06:27.208
where every person is different.

107
00:06:27.208 --> 00:06:31.041
As if one being right will make another wrong,

108
00:06:31.041 --> 00:06:36.208
as if one's success will 
make another unsuccessful.

109
00:06:36.208 --> 00:06:39.750
And because of all these, misconceptions

110
00:06:39.750 --> 00:06:42.333
and discord arise.

111
00:06:42.333 --> 00:06:47.500
But if a person develops this perspective

112
00:06:47.500 --> 00:06:52.250
that I alone am present in everyone's heart,

113
00:06:52.250 --> 00:06:56.333
all are parts of me just like you,

114
00:06:56.333 --> 00:07:00.750
then it will change the very form of family life.

115
00:07:00.750 --> 00:07:04.708
This perspective reminds you

116
00:07:04.708 --> 00:07:09.041
that if I am in your heart,

117
00:07:09.041 --> 00:07:12.250
then I also reside in the hearts 
of your brother, sister, parents,

118
00:07:12.250 --> 00:07:18.791
your life partner, your children, everyone.

119
00:07:18.791 --> 00:07:20.916
Will one drop of the ocean

120
00:07:20.916 --> 00:07:24.750
have discord with another drop?

121
00:07:24.750 --> 00:07:25.791
No, right?

122
00:07:25.791 --> 00:07:31.375
Similarly, you all are also parts of me,

123
00:07:31.375 --> 00:07:33.583
so why this tension?

124
00:07:33.583 --> 00:07:38.083
This understanding will 
make you more sensitive.

125
00:07:38.083 --> 00:07:43.166
You'll start respecting 
others' personal journeys too.

126
00:07:43.166 --> 00:07:47.541
Remember, everyone has their own life,

127
00:07:47.541 --> 00:07:54.000
I am giving everyone appropriate
 guidance according to time,

128
00:07:54.000 --> 00:07:58.125
I am present in everyone.

129
00:08:03.083 --> 00:08:09.208
In today's professional world, there's an 
atmosphere of competition,

130
00:08:09.208 --> 00:08:11.916
and where there's competition,

131
00:08:11.916 --> 00:08:15.500
dissatisfaction and jealousy are also

132
00:08:15.500 --> 00:08:18.083
common.

133
00:08:18.083 --> 00:08:21.000
When someone else gets success,

134
00:08:21.000 --> 00:08:23.333
there's dissatisfaction in the mind.

135
00:08:23.333 --> 00:08:26.833
When a colleague is rewarded,

136
00:08:26.833 --> 00:08:28.625
there's jealousy.

137
00:08:28.625 --> 00:08:30.833
There are many such examples.

138
00:08:30.833 --> 00:08:33.833
This happens because

139
00:08:33.833 --> 00:08:37.250
in the professional world we 
view our fellow travelers,

140
00:08:37.250 --> 00:08:43.791
or our organization's colleagues
 from a material perspective.

141
00:08:43.791 --> 00:08:46.791
It seems that success, respect,

142
00:08:46.791 --> 00:08:50.583
etc. are available in very limited quantity.

143
00:08:50.583 --> 00:08:53.166
If someone else gets all this,

144
00:08:53.166 --> 00:08:56.041
it will be snatched from you.

145
00:08:56.041 --> 00:09:00.750
A person sees everyone as a competitor.

146
00:09:00.750 --> 00:09:02.750
But what if

147
00:09:02.750 --> 00:09:06.333
you change your perspective?

148
00:09:06.333 --> 00:09:14.291
If you also consider your colleagues 
as a part of me, just like you.

149
00:09:14.291 --> 00:09:21.208
This will make you realize a divine
 connection among each other.

150
00:09:21.208 --> 00:09:25.041
Also, someone getting respect or success

151
00:09:25.041 --> 00:09:30.708
doesn't reduce your share of success.

152
00:09:30.708 --> 00:09:32.166
Everything

153
00:09:32.166 --> 00:09:35.208
will definitely come at the right time.

154
00:09:35.208 --> 00:09:39.125
If there's such a divine 
connection among each other,

155
00:09:39.125 --> 00:09:43.250
and if everyone's share of success

156
00:09:43.250 --> 00:09:49.541
is in my divine plan, then why competition?

157
00:09:49.541 --> 00:09:52.916
Why not cooperation?

158
00:09:52.916 --> 00:09:56.541
You'll cooperate in others' success,

159
00:09:56.541 --> 00:09:59.458
in return you will also definitely receive

160
00:09:59.458 --> 00:10:05.458
help sent by me through someone else.

161
00:10:05.458 --> 00:10:08.416
Put cooperation in place of competition,

162
00:10:08.416 --> 00:10:11.041
take inspiration in place of jealousy,

163
00:10:11.041 --> 00:10:14.958
and instead of pulling others back,

164
00:10:14.958 --> 00:10:18.833
become helpful in each other's advancement.

165
00:10:18.833 --> 00:10:21.791
Try keeping this perspective,

166
00:10:21.791 --> 00:10:27.875
you'll experience many positive
 changes in professional life.
